<section class="answer-block" id="answer" aria-label="Direct answer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="answer-q">What frameworks does Khadija Zaman use for AI search visibility?</h2>
    <p class="answer-a">Khadija Zaman uses the R2A Content Framework, an eight-layer model that scores a page from retrieval to action, and its instruments: the BERAP Map for what AI models recall about a brand, the Retrieval Unit Map and the Representation Parity Map. Each is a practitioner model with an evidence grade on every recommendation, not an official model from any search engine.</p>
  </div>
</section>

